## Quick Protocol

1. Read context files above
2. Find your task in `.jonggrang/jonggrang-tasks.json` (status: `in_progress`)
3. If task has `"skill"` field, read `.claude/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md`
4. Implement the task following AGENTS.md conventions
5. Run validation: typecheck, tests, lint
6. Update `.jonggrang/jonggrang-tasks.json` (status: completed, passes: true)
7. Append learnings to `.jonggrang/progress.txt`
8. Commit with: `git commit -m "type(scope): description"`

